# > Asphalt 8 (狂野飙车8) & Gameloft 游戏专项分流规则
# 维护仓库: doge2mars/my-proxy-rules
# 作用: 保证大厅登录 (gameloft.com) 与对战房间 (AWS 美东纯IP服务器) 100% 走同一出口，彻底解决断线与异地封号

# === [1. Gameloft 大厅、匹配与 API 域名] ===
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gameloft.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gameloft.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gameloftbroadcast.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gameloft-cdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gameloft.it
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gameloft-sns.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,gameloft
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,asphalt8

# === [2. Gameloft A8 多人房间集群 (AWS 美东对战服务器网段与高频IP)] ===
# 实测捕获端口: 33052, 33098, 35893 等高位对战房
IP-CIDR,100.59.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,100.31.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,100.51.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,18.232.0.0/14,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,54.88.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,54.208.0.0/13,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,52.0.0.0/11,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,3.80.0.0/12,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,3.208.0.0/12,no-resolve
